{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19884","headline":"自惜 · 孟郊","name":"自惜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾尽眼中力，抄诗过与人。\n自悲风雅老，恐被巴竹嗔。\n零落雪文字，分明镜精神。\n坐甘冰抱晚，永谢酒怀春。\n徒有言言旧，慙无默默新。\n始惊儒教误，渐与佛乘亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}